ted petitions opposing the campuses.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Supercomputers and data centers are necessary to power AI systems, though they've often drawn ire from communities where the hulking facilities are built.","zh":null},{"en":"Colossus and Colossus 2 are no different.","zh":null},{"en":"Residents near Memphis have packed public hearings, staged protests, and created petitions opposing the campuses.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>In April, the NAACP filed a lawsuit against xAI and its subsidiary, MZX Tech, saying they were unlawfully operating unpermitted methane gas turbines to power Colossus 2. The complaint said xAI was operating the unpermitted gas turbines in Southaven, Mississippi, which is less than 20 minutes away. Last week, a US District Judge denied xAI and MZX Tech's motion to dismiss the lawsuit.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"In April, the NAACP filed a lawsuit against xAI and its subsidiary, MZX Tech, saying they were unlawfully operating unpermitted methane gas turbines to power Colossus 2.","zh":null},{"en":"The complaint said xAI was operating the unpermitted gas turbines in Southaven, Mississippi, which is less than 20 minutes away.","zh":null},{"en":"Last week, a US District Judge denied xAI and MZX Tech's motion to dismiss the lawsuit.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Read next</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Read next","zh":"阅读下一篇"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know</span>\n                          </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know","zh":"商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know</span>\n                          </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know","zh":"商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovative stories 